So, it's called

00:04:40.331 --> 00:04:41.790
American Song Contest,

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:44.190
and I've been talking to the producers

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:48.370
of "The Voice" and "Eurovision"
for a minute about it.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:49.990
I've been obsessed with "Eurovision".

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:53.060
So, when I went overseas, like, years ago,

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:54.620
you know, after winning "Idol",

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:56.530
I noticed, like, there
was this huge competition,

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:57.363
and I never heard of it before,

00:04:57.363 --> 00:04:59.330
and it's called "Eurovision,"
and it was amazing.

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:00.320
And I thought it was so cool

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.460
'cause all the territories
get represented.

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:04.720
So, they're finally bringing
it over to the States,

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:07.370
and it's called American
Song Contest, ASC,

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.530
and it's really cool because I feel like

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.720
I think everybody could agree,

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:13.380
we're pretty divided, like, as a nation,

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:16.045
and it's really cool,
'cause all 50 states,

00:05:16.045 --> 00:05:17.960
there's five US territories,

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.570
and then,

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:22.780
DC, our nation's capital,
everybody gets represented.

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:25.750
So, like, there's a person
representing every state,

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:29.430
every part and they all
enter in this competition.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:30.700
And the cool thing about it too,

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:32.510
is that it's original songs,

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:34.330
and as a songwriter, I
think that's awesome.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:35.360
- Oh, yes.
- 'Cause it's, like,

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:36.520
a different, you know, like,

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:38.090
there's a lot of shows
out there, you know,

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:40.480
that have competitions with like,

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.870
you know, singing or artists or whatever,

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:44.940
and it's really cool 'cause
the best song wins out;

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.491
and I'm co-hosting with Snoop Dogg.

00:05:47.491 --> 00:05:48.537
- Ay! (claps hands)
- We got to

00:05:48.537 --> 00:05:49.745
