- (laughs) I love it!

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:54.080
We worked together on "The
Voice". It was so fun.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:55.760
- Yeah, he's great. He's great.

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:58.230
You know, I know him from
baby boy, years, years ago

00:05:58.230 --> 00:05:59.080
