- put pastel colors.
- Easter. Yeah.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:32.070
I won't judge you then. (laughs)

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:32.903
- I don't, you know what?

00:08:32.903 --> 00:08:33.971
Judge away America,

00:08:33.971 --> 00:08:34.990
I'm used to it.
- (laughs) That's right.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:39.200
That's I love you, do what's
good for you! (laughs)

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:40.960
Look, I have to get to
the rest of the show.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:44.010
The Irwins are here and
I have a great story

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:46.420
about teens using music
to help their peers

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.120
cope with stress.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:50.070
Anything you want me to ask our guests?

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:53.130
- Hey, I love the latter,

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:53.990
the last thing you just talked about.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:54.981
- Me too, me too.
- That's how

00:08:54.981 --> 00:08:55.950
I started writing actually,

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:57.810
'cause I had a problem with emoting,

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:00.840
and my mom actually
told me to start writing

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:02.290
and use music as my outlet.

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.770
That is such a,

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:04.620
that's such a beautiful thing.

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:06.050
Like, you can have nothing in common

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:08.050
but like you can have music

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:10.210
and it's so powerful, so, I
love that you're doing that.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.043
- Absolutely.

00:09:11.043 --> 00:09:13.520
I think it's beautiful what
these young guys are doing.

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:15.310
I can't wait to meet them.
(audience clapping)

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:16.631
I can't.

00:09:16.631 --> 00:09:19.046
- Well, hopefully they dressed up.

00:09:19.046 --> 00:09:19.987
I'm just sitting here,
- Yeah. (laughs)

00:09:19.987 --> 00:09:21.610
- in my robe brought to
you by Chrissy Teigen.

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:22.846
Thank you girl!

00:09:22.846 --> 00:09:24.130
(Taraji and Kelly laughing)

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:27.690
- Well, Kelly is always
good to see you, honey.

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:29.357
Okay? Good to see you.
- All right, bye Taraji.

00:09:29.357 --> 00:09:30.270
- Take care.
- Thank you so much.

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:34.013
- Yes, mama, stay safe! (lips smacking)

